// ============================================================
// QUERY: Graph API Reconnaissance Pattern Detection
// Incident: INC-2026-87241
// Table: MicrosoftGraphActivityLogs
// Purpose: Detect pre-authentication MFA posture profiling and
//          group membership enumeration via Microsoft Graph API.
//          These calls were made by the attacker BEFORE the breach
//          to identify MFA gaps and org structure.
// Platform: Microsoft Sentinel
// ============================================================

MicrosoftGraphActivityLogs
| where RequestUri contains "/reports/authenticationMethods/userRegistrationDetails"
   or RequestUri contains "/me/memberOf"
| where TimeGenerated >= ago(24h)
| summarize ReconCount = count() by IPAddress, RequestUri
| where ReconCount > 2

// ============================================================
// INCIDENT CONTEXT:
//   - Attacker IP:        103.69.224.136 (Amsterdam, NL)
//   - Recon Window:       2026-06-10 22:09:37 – 22:12:26 UTC
//
//   CALL 1 — MFA Posture Profiling (3 calls):
//     RequestUri: /beta/reports/authenticationMethods/userRegistrationDetails
//     Filter:     userPrincipalName eq 'm.smith@lognpacific.org' and isMfaCapable eq true
//     Purpose:    Check if m.smith has MFA registered
//     Finding:    m.smith IS MFA-capable, but legacy auth path doesn't enforce it
//
//   CALL 2 — Group Membership Enumeration:
//     RequestUri: /v1.0/users/fa5020a1-0d42-4839-bbfe-22db0861ced5/memberOf/microsoft.graph.group/$count
//     Purpose:    Discover what security groups m.smith belongs to
//     Finding:    Payment approval groups, finance teams, delegation chains
//
// WHY THIS MATTERS:
//   The attacker used Graph API to profile the target BEFORE attempting
//   authentication. This is sophisticated pre-attack reconnaissance that
//   most orgs do not alert on. Detecting these patterns early can provide
//   up to 4 minutes of advance warning before the breach.
//
// TUNING:
//   - Adjust ReconCount threshold based on legitimate API usage patterns
//   - Scope to external/unexpected IPs for reduced noise
//   - Consider correlating with subsequent SigninLogs activity from same IP
//   - Add /beta/users/ and /me/transitiveMemberOf/ as additional recon indicators
// ============================================================
